Package: corpus-querier
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Predrag Kovačević
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, libxft2, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libxcb1, zlib1g
Description: Desktop corpus research tool for CLARIN.SI and the RNC
 Corpus Querier runs CLARIN.SI CQL and Russian National Corpus lexical-
 grammatical searches. It supports batch spreadsheets, reusable templates,
 exact totals, form results and provider-specific research metadata.
